  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHC runs a number of projects regarding HR, media and culture in the former Yugoslavia. 25% of the total framework agreement concerns non-programmed funds, that SHC in co-ooperation with Sida can deploy during the year. SHC primarily concentrates on media projects in the region and closely co-operates with i a MDLF regarding training and credit schemes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SHK driver ett femtiotal projekt kring MR-fr&#xe5;gor, media och kultur i det forna Jugoslavien. Ramavtalet omfattar 25% i oprogrammerade medel, som de i samr&#xe5;d med Sida kan anv&#xe4;nda f&#xf6;r nya projekt under &#xe5;ret. Tyngdpunkten ligger p&#xe5; mediaprojekt i regionen och man samarbetar bl a med MDLF kring utbildning och krediter.</narrative>
  </description>
